    "summary": "Mogadishu has moved to distance itself from a social media post by parliament speaker Abdulkadir Mohamed Nur, who thanked a official from the Turkish Republic of Northern Cyprus, a state Somalia does not recognize. The incident has prompted a four-day diplomatic response to reaffirm Somalia's position on territorial integrity.",
